# .NET Ecosystem

## What is .NET?

.NET is a software development platform developed by Microsoft.

## What is C#?

C# is an object-oriented programming language used with the .NET platform.

## Frontend

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Backend

- C#
- ASP.NET Core

## Database

- SQL Server

## MVC

- Model
- View
- Controller

## Web API

Used for communication between applications using HTTP requests and responses.

## Development Tools

- Visual Studio 2022
- SQL Server
- SSMS